        "original_id": "41bffceb-818e-5bd1-b69f-9a92b5ea1148",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rico Blanco\n- Bands: Rivermaya, Kodaline, 21 Demands\n- Songs: \"Give Me a Minute\"\n- Places: Philippines, Ireland, Dublin\n- Topics: rock music, solo artists, Irish Singles Chart\n\nFacts:\n- Rivermaya is a Filipino rock band.\n- Rico Blanco began his career as a founding member of Rivermaya in 1994 and served as its chief songwriter, vocalist, guitarist, and keyboardist until 2007.\n- \"Give Me a Minute\" is a song by the Dublin rock band 21 Demands that was released in March 2007.\n- \"Give Me a Minute\" reached the Irish Singles Chart for the chart dated 22 March 2007.\n- Rico Blanco has been a solo artist since 2008.\n- Kodaline are an Irish band.",
